n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Atletas filiados com dorsal e chip AARAM:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Prova Jovens Sub-14 e Sub-16<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:05<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita para escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Prova Jovens Sub-10 e Sub-12<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do Grande Pr\u00e9mio das Vindimas 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 13 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09h00 para os escal\u00f5es jovens e partida da corrida principal de 4,7 km \u00e0s 09h20.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se situa a partida e a meta do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida e a meta est\u00e3o localizadas junto \u00e0 Escola B\u00e1sica do 1\u00ba Ciclo do Estreito de C\u00e2mara de Lobos, na Ilha da Madeira.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui a prova principal de 4,7 km (Sub-18 a Veteranos), a corrida de 1,6 km (Sub-14 e Sub-16) e a corrida de 0,5 km (Sub-10 e Sub-12).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e participa\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas com situa\u00e7\u00e3o regularizada e dorsal com chip atribu\u00eddo pela AARAM n\u00e3o necessitam de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o pr\u00e9via. Os atletas sem chip devem solicit\u00e1-lo \u00e0 associa\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 2 dias antes do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova pontua para circuitos oficiais de atletismo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a prova pontua para as tabelas classificativas individuais e coletivas dos circuitos regionais Madeira a Correr e Mini Madeira a Correr da \u00e9poca 2025\/2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Grande Pr\u00e9mio das Vindimas 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Estreito de C\u00e2mara de Lobos, Madeira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"C\u00e2mara de Lobos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Madeira\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"GDE \/ AARAM (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Madeira)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do Grande Pr\u00e9mio das Vindimas 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 13 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09h00 para os escal\u00f5es jovens e partida da corrida principal de 4,7 km \u00e0s 09h20.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se situa a partida e a meta do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida e a meta est\u00e3o localizadas junto \u00e0 Escola B\u00e1sica do 1\u00ba Ciclo do Estreito de C\u00e2mara de Lobos, na Ilha da Madeira.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui a prova principal de 4,7 km (Sub-18 a Veteranos), a corrida de 1,6 km (Sub-14 e Sub-16) e a corrida de 0,5 km (Sub-10 e Sub-12).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e participa\u00e7\u00e3o na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas com situa\u00e7\u00e3o regularizada e dorsal com chip atribu\u00eddo pela AARAM n\u00e3o necessitam de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o pr\u00e9via. Os atletas sem chip devem solicit\u00e1-lo \u00e0 associa\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 2 dias antes do evento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova pontua para circuitos oficiais de atletismo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a prova pontua para as tabelas classificativas individuais e coletivas dos circuitos regionais Madeira a Correr e Mini Madeira a Correr da \u00e9poca 2025\/2026.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66742,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,624],"event_type_2":[36,820],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66743","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-camara-de-lobos-madeira","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-madeira","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_3-gratuita-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/grande-premio-das-vindimas-2026-736x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66743","targetHints":{"allow":["